alias lever d0
alias electricUmbilical d1
alias LED d2

awaitingActivation:
s LED On 1
s LED Color 2
s electricUmbilical Open 0
l r0 lever Open
beq r0 1 openUmbilical
yield
j awaitingActivation

openUmbilical:
s LED On 1
s LED Color 4
s electricUmbilical Open 1
l r0 lever Open
beq r0 1 openUmbilical
j awaitingActivation